{
  "id": "the-simpsons---7x06---treehouse-of-horror-vi",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 7x06 - Treehouse Of Horror VI",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 7x06 - Treehouse Of Horror VI.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T21:02:57.058Z",
  "lineCount": 259,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Ah, the Miracle Mile, where value wears a neon sombrero... and there's not a single church or library to offend the eye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 31664,
      "endMs": 38267
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "There it is!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38371,
      "endMs": 40839
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The chain that put the \"fat\" in fat Southern sheriffs.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 40940,
      "endMs": 44273
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I want a colossal doughnut, just like the one on the sign.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44377,
      "endMs": 47904
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "D'oh! Nuts!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 48014,
      "endMs": 49879
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "That's false advertising!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49983,
      "endMs": 51883
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Sorry, sir. No refunds.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51985,
      "endMs": 53919
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "I paid for a colossal doughnut... and I'm gonna get a colossal doughnut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 54020,
      "endMs": 60951
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "You don't scare us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 61061,
      "endMs": 63393
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Astronomers from Tacoma to Vladivostok havejust reported... an ionic disturbance in the vicinity of the Van Allen belt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 69202,
      "endMs": 76275
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Scientists are recommending that all necessary precautions be taken.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 76376,
      "endMs": 79106
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Eggheads. What do they know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 79212,
      "endMs": 82045
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Hee-hee-hee! I got your doughnut, Lard Lad!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92292,
      "endMs": 95955
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "And what are you gonna do about it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96062,
      "endMs": 98496
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Homer, where did you get that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117250,
      "endMs": 119980
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Get what? That giant doughnut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120086,
      "endMs": 121951
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Well, I acquired it legally. You can be sure of that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122055,
      "endMs": 125650
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Dude, you're huge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130597,
      "endMs": 133657
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Yeah! Let's party, baby!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133766,
      "endMs": 135666
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Hey-hey-hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 135768,
      "endMs": 137531
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Fellas, where you going at this hour?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143610,
      "endMs": 146204
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Hey, don't scratch up them heads!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146312,
      "endMs": 148542
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Good morning, everybody.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 148648,
      "endMs": 150548
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Panic is gripping Springfield as giant advertising mascots rampage through the city.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150650,
      "endMs": 154552
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Perhaps it's part of some daring new ad campaign.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 154654,
      "endMs": 157555
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "But what new product could justify such carnage? A cleanser?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157657,
      "endMs": 160558
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "A fat-free fudge cake that doesn't let you down in the flavor department... like so many others- Let me go! No! Stop! No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 160660,
      "endMs": 170033
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Whoa! Another acid flashback.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173106,
      "endMs": 175973
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Man, I'd hate to be driving a bus right now!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176075,
      "endMs": 178703
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Aw, they're not so tough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192725,
      "endMs": 194625
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Chief, that wasn't a monster. That was the captain of the high school basketball team.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194727,
      "endMs": 198458
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Uh, yeah, well, he was turning into a monster though.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 198565,
      "endMs": 201762
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "What are you waiting for? Wreck the school. You know you wanna.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203836,
      "endMs": 207101
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "I agree. Destroy the school. Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 207207,
      "endMs": 210005
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Hello? Yes? Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216149,
      "endMs": 219141
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "If you're looking for that big doughnut of yours, Flanders has it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 219252,
      "endMs": 223154
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Just smash open his house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223256,
      "endMs": 225224
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "He came to life. Good for him!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 225325,
      "endMs": 228692
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Help me, Lord.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235935,
      "endMs": 237835
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I told you, Flanders has it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 237937,
      "endMs": 240838
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Or Moe. Go kill Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 240940,
      "endMs": 243306
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Just give him the doughnut! Once he has it, that will be the end of all this horror!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 243409,
      "endMs": 248005
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Well, okay. If it'll end horror.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248114,
      "endMs": 251515
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Don't you ever get tired of being wrong all the time?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263196,
      "endMs": 266097
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Sometimes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 266199,
      "endMs": 268099
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "These monsters are destroying everything and everyone we hold dear!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280980,
      "endMs": 284609
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "And you kids should have jackets on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284717,
      "endMs": 286617
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Hey! What's that in his footprint?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286719,
      "endMs": 288812
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291224,
      "endMs": 293488
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "If your advertising agency created all those giant characters... you must know how to stop them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293593,
      "endMs": 299163
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Well, sir, advertising is a funny thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 299265,
      "endMs": 302098
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "If people stop paying attention to it, pretty soon it goes away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302201,
      "endMs": 305728
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Like that old woman who couldn't find the beef? Exactly!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305838,
      "endMs": 308739
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "If you stop paying attention to the monsters, they'll lose their powers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308841,
      "endMs": 312368
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "But people can't help looking at them. They're wrecking the town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 312478,
      "endMs": 314878
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "You know, maybe a jingle would help.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316749,
      "endMs": 319741
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Don't watch the mon- Don't watch the... monsters-s-s-s Well, it'll sound a lot better coming out of Paul Anka.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319852,
      "endMs": 329551
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Hey, Springfield.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329662,
      "endMs": 332222
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Are you suffering from the heartbreak of monsteritis?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 332332,
      "endMs": 336894
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Then take a tip from Mr. Paul Anka!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 337003,
      "endMs": 340598
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "To stop those monsters one, two, three Here's a fresh new way that's trouble-free It's got Paul Anka's guarantee Guarantee void in Tennessee Just don't look Just don't look",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340707,
      "endMs": 355580
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Just don't look Just don't look",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358191,
      "endMs": 360887
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Just don't look Just don't look",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 363129,
      "endMs": 365962
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "It worked! They're all dead!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 376008,
      "endMs": 377908
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Well, except for chubsy-ubsy over there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378010,
      "endMs": 381104
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Mmm. Sprinkles!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382382,
      "endMs": 384350
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Homer, stop looking! Don't make us poke your eyes out, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 384450,
      "endMs": 387010
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Ohh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 387120,
      "endMs": 388587
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Here comes something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 392625,
      "endMs": 394525
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Remember the story. We're newlyweds on our way to Earth capital.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394627,
      "endMs": 398063
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Oh, shazbatt!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 399098,
      "endMs": 400998
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Even as I speak, the scourge of advertising could be heading toward your town!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 401100,
      "endMs": 405036
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Lock your doors! Bar your windows!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 405138,
      "endMs": 407402
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Because the next advertisement you see could destroy your house and eat your family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 407507,
      "endMs": 412240
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "We'll be right back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412345,
      "endMs": 414142
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Okay, boy. Catch the Frisbee.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420553,
      "endMs": 423317
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Good catch, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424390,
      "endMs": 426688
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Thanks, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426793,
      "endMs": 428420
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Oh, hard luck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 433733,
      "endMs": 436702
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Glad to \"rake\" your acquaintance.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 444977,
      "endMs": 446877
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "It was only a dream.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455421,
      "endMs": 457946
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Bart.! Is that you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 458057,
      "endMs": 461049
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Yes! Take out the garbage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461160,
      "endMs": 463128
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "And then he raked me across the chest.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 464630,
      "endMs": 466530
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "And the weirdest thing was, it was that school janitor who mysteriously disappeared!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466632,
      "endMs": 471592
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Groundskeeper Willie! Oh, my god!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471704,
      "endMs": 474229
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Bart, Groundskeeper Willie was in my nightmare too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474340,
      "endMs": 476570
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "But he got me with hedge clippers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476676,
      "endMs": 480168
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "He ran his floor buffer over me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480279,
      "endMs": 483373
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Children, I couldn't help monitoring your conversation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483483,
      "endMs": 486384
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "There's no mystery about Willie. Why, he simply disappeared.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 486486,
      "endMs": 490650
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Now, let's have no more curiosity about this bizarre cover-up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 490756,
      "endMs": 494089
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Remember, class, the worse you do on this standardized test... the more funding the school gets, so don't knock yourselves out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 495595,
      "endMs": 500725
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "You have three hours to- Finished!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500833,
      "endMs": 503131
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Then put your head down on your desk and sit quietly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503236,
      "endMs": 506763
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Ahh. A duet of pleasures.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 506873,
      "endMs": 509842
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "I am the Wondrous Wizard of Latin!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511077,
      "endMs": 513705
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "I am a dervish of declension and a conjurer of conjugation... with a million hit points and maximum charisma!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513813,
      "endMs": 520317
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Ah-ha! Morire: To die!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 520419,
      "endMs": 523183
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Morit: He, she, or it dies!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 523289,
      "endMs": 526383
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Moris: You die!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 526492,
      "endMs": 529757
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "You've mastered a dead tongue! But can you handle a live one?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532298,
      "endMs": 535529
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Ha-ha!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546145,
      "endMs": 548272
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Wheel him out quietly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 549515,
      "endMs": 551278
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "It's best the children don't see him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551384,
      "endMs": 553909
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Oh, just get it out of here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 554020,
      "endMs": 557251
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Not into the kindergarten!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 558591,
      "endMs": 561151
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Mom! Dad! Martin died at school today!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561260,
      "endMs": 564559
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Ohhh! I don't see what that has to do with Groundskeeper Willie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 564664,
      "endMs": 568566
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Um, we didn't mention Groundskeeper Willie, Mom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568668,
      "endMs": 573503
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Kids, it's time we told you the true story and put your fears to rest.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 575608,
      "endMs": 579476
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "It's a story of murder and revenge from beyond the grave.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579579,
      "endMs": 584243
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "It all started on the 13th hour of the 13th day... of the 13th month.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 584350,
      "endMs": 590885
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "We were there to discuss the misprinted calendars the school had purchased.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 590990,
      "endMs": 594255
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Lousy \"Smarch\" weather.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596362,
      "endMs": 598853
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "\"Do not touch Willie. \" Good advice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 598965,
      "endMs": 600956
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605071,
      "endMs": 606971
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Our next budget item, $12 for doorknob repair. Nay!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 609208,
      "endMs": 612439
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Recharge fire extinguishers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 615314,
      "endMs": 617214
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "This is a free service of the fire department. Nay!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617316,
      "endMs": 620285
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Help! Please help me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 625825,
      "endMs": 628020
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Willie, please! Mr. Van Houten has the floor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628127,
      "endMs": 630891
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "I, for one, would like to see the cafeteria menus in advance... so parents can adjust their dinner menus accordingly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 630997,
      "endMs": 636800
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "I don't like the idea of Milhouse having two spaghetti meals in one day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 636902,
      "endMs": 641168
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "You'll pay for this with your children's blood!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646946,
      "endMs": 651315
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Oh, right. How you gonna get 'em? Skeleton power?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651417,
      "endMs": 654352
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "I'll strike where you cannot protect them- in their dreams!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654453,
      "endMs": 661459
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Bart, don't you realize what this means? The next time we fall asleep, we could die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664930,
      "endMs": 669958
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Bah! Welcome to my world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670069,
      "endMs": 671764
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Announcer] On this edition of Asian Market Wrap-up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 675675,
      "endMs": 678576
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "There's a volcano waiting to erupt in the Pacific Rim.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678678,
      "endMs": 681511
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "It's nine medium-term, convertible debentures- It's no use, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681614,
      "endMs": 686250
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "We can't stay up forever! You're right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686352,
      "endMs": 688718
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "The only thing left to do is go into my dream and force Willie into a final showdown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 688821,
      "endMs": 694282
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "You stay awake. And if it looks like I'm in trouble, wake me up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 694393,
      "endMs": 697089
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Okay. But promise you won't be grouchy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697196,
      "endMs": 699596
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Come on, Willie. I know you're out there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711744,
      "endMs": 714611
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "The sandbox.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725157,
      "endMs": 726886
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Hey, Lawn Boy.! You missed a spot.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737837,
      "endMs": 740863
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "When I'm done with you, they'll have to do a \"compost-mortem!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742775,
      "endMs": 747803
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Sinky sand!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757323,
      "endMs": 760417
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "No! Help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761761,
      "endMs": 764286
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Willie's gone for good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764396,
      "endMs": 766887
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Now I can get back to my normal dreams- me and Krusty winning the Super Bowl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 766999,
      "endMs": 771095
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Bart, there's two seconds left.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 771203,
      "endMs": 773103
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Listen up. It's your basic Statue of Liberty play with one twist.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 773205,
      "endMs": 776106
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "You throw it to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 776208,
      "endMs": 778108
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Knute Rockne called it \"the forward pass. \" Now, the clock's still running, so it's important we start this play as quickly as possible.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778210,
      "endMs": 784012
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Oh-ho, boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784116,
      "endMs": 787017
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Don't dream about me no more, kid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 787119,
      "endMs": 789212
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Help! Lisa, help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 789321,
      "endMs": 791346
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Bart, you're in trouble! Wake up! Wait a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 791457,
      "endMs": 793789
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "If you're here, then you've fallen asleep too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793893,
      "endMs": 796521
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "I'm not asleep. I'm just resting my eye- Uh-oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796629,
      "endMs": 800326
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Good-bye, Bart. Good-bye, Lise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 804069,
      "endMs": 806299
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "I hope you get reincarnated as someone who can stay awake for 15 minutes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 806405,
      "endMs": 810034
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "You saved us, Maggie!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 827560,
      "endMs": 830028
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "I don't know, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 835668,
      "endMs": 837568
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Something tells me Willie's still out there, and that he could come back... any time, in any form, and kill us in ways we can't even imagine!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 837670,
      "endMs": 843972
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Boo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 847346,
      "endMs": 849246
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Here I am. Yah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 851617,
      "endMs": 854745
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "No! Stop! I left my gun on the seat!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 854854,
      "endMs": 858119
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 858224,
      "endMs": 860124
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Wait here, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860226,
      "endMs": 862387
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Aw, geez!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864897,
      "endMs": 866865
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Homer, get ready.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871170,
      "endMs": 874401
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Patty and Selma will be here any minute.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 874506,
      "endMs": 877771
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Oh, no! Better ride this one out in the closet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 877877,
      "endMs": 881574
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Sorry, Dad. This is our spot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881680,
      "endMs": 883580
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Oh, yeah? Well, it's my house, so it's my spot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883682,
      "endMs": 887311
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Nu-uh, because we called it. Did not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 887419,
      "endMs": 888977
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Well, we're calling it now. You are?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 889088,
      "endMs": 890578
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "'Fraid so. Ohh! They got me with their legal mumbo jumbo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 890689,
      "endMs": 893715
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Just a second.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 901734,
      "endMs": 903395
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Huh? I never looked behind this whatchamacallit case before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905871,
      "endMs": 909238
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Huh? That's weird.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911610,
      "endMs": 914101
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "It's like something out of that twilight-y show about that zone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 914213,
      "endMs": 917842
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "How's it hangin', Marge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 918951,
      "endMs": 920851
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Yuck! I'm baking like a meat loaf under this wet wool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920953,
      "endMs": 924116
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Uh, may I take your coat, Aunt Selma?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925824,
      "endMs": 928622
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Um, I would also like to take your coat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928727,
      "endMs": 931924
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Have we got a family activity for you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933332,
      "endMs": 936324
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "A pillow case full of seashells from our trip to Sulfur Bay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 936435,
      "endMs": 939063
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "You're gonna help us clean and organize them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 939171,
      "endMs": 941071
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "And pry out all the dead hermit crabs. Get a screwdriver.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941173,
      "endMs": 944768
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "I'll take my chances in the mystery wall!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944877,
      "endMs": 948404
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Oh, glory of glories!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958824,
      "endMs": 960985
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Oh, heavenly testament to the eternal majesty of God's creation!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961093,
      "endMs": 965393
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Holy macaroni!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965497,
      "endMs": 967590
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Hey, you can just suck 'em out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 972204,
      "endMs": 974434
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Hello? Can anybody hear me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 974540,
      "endMs": 977373
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Homer, where are you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977476,
      "endMs": 979376
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Uh, I'm somewhere where I don't know where I am.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979478,
      "endMs": 982379
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Do you see towels? If you see towels, you're probably in the linen closet again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982481,
      "endMs": 986383
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Just a second.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 986485,
      "endMs": 988783
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "No, it's a place I've never been before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988887,
      "endMs": 991788
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Uh-huh. The shower.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 991890,
      "endMs": 993289
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Hey.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 993392,
      "endMs": 995883
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "I don't want to alarm you, Marge... but I seem to be trapped in here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004169,
      "endMs": 1008571
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "We'd better call Ned. He has a ladder.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1008674,
      "endMs": 1011734
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "What's going on here? I'm so bulgy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011844,
      "endMs": 1015871
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "My stomach sticks way out in front and my-",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1018150,
      "endMs": 1021278
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Well, as the tree said to the lumberjack, I'm stumped.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1022821,
      "endMs": 1026279
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "It's like he just disappeared into fat air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1026392,
      "endMs": 1028622
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Hey, shut up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1030729,
      "endMs": 1032697
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Mmm! Unprocessed fish sticks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044676,
      "endMs": 1048578
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Man, this place looks expensive!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060325,
      "endMs": 1063123
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "I feel like I'm wasting a fortune just standing here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1063228,
      "endMs": 1066857
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Better make the most of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1069968,
      "endMs": 1072266
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Ow! Watch it, coney!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1074573,
      "endMs": 1077599
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Whoops.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1081713,
      "endMs": 1083271
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Do you see a light, Homer? Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1083382,
      "endMs": 1086112
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Move into the light, my son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086218,
      "endMs": 1088516
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Ow.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1088620,
      "endMs": 1090520
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Homer, this is your physician, DoctorJulius Hibbert.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090622,
      "endMs": 1093523
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Can you tell us what it's like in there?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093625,
      "endMs": 1095889
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Um, it's like, uh- Did anyone see the movie Tron?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1095994,
      "endMs": 1101488
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "No. - No. - No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1101600,
      "endMs": 1102862
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "No. - No. - No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1102968,
      "endMs": 1103992
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "No. - No. - No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1104103,
      "endMs": 1105536
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "No. - No. - Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1105637,
      "endMs": 1107502
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Er, um, I mean, no. No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1107606,
      "endMs": 1109574
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Well, where's my dad?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1111477,
      "endMs": 1113377
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Well, it should be obvious to even the most dimwitted individual... who holds an advanced degree in hyperbolic topology... that Homer Simpson has stumbled into... the third dimension.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113479,
      "endMs": 1126051
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126158,
      "endMs": 1128217
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Here is an ordinary square.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1129862,
      "endMs": 1132194
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Whoa! Whoa! Slow down, egghead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1132297,
      "endMs": 1134697
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "But suppose we extend the square beyond the two dimensions of our universe... along the hypothetical \"Z\" axis there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134800,
      "endMs": 1142407
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "This forms... a three-dimensional object known as a cube... or a \"Frinkahedron,\" in honor of its discoverer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1142508,
      "endMs": 1151181
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Help me.! Are you helping me? Or are you going on and on?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1151283,
      "endMs": 1155185
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Oh, right. And, of course, within we find the doomed individual.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155287,
      "endMs": 1158916
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Enough of your borax, Poindexter! A man's life is at stake! We need action!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159024,
      "endMs": 1163859
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Take that, you lousy dimension!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1165397,
      "endMs": 1167922
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Huh? Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1168033,
      "endMs": 1169933
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Oh, there's so much I don't know about astrophysics.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1175040,
      "endMs": 1178635
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "I wish I read that book by that wheelchair guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178744,
      "endMs": 1181645
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "I'll save Homer! All I needs is four stout men to work the bellows.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194493,
      "endMs": 1199396
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "No, Pops. It's too risky.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1199498,
      "endMs": 1201398
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "For all we know, there could be cubes in there the size of gorillas and other large- Help.! I don't have much time.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1201500,
      "endMs": 1207469
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "That does it! I'm going in!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207573,
      "endMs": 1209473
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Bart, no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209575,
      "endMs": 1211270
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Cool, man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1215681,
      "endMs": 1217911
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "I'm gonna be sucked into a black hole! I'm gonna be sucked into oblivion!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1223355,
      "endMs": 1226882
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "And what's gonna become of me on the other side? I don't know!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1226992,
      "endMs": 1229927
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "I'll save you, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1230028,
      "endMs": 1232394
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "I can't get any closer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1234032,
      "endMs": 1236432
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "You'll have to jump!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1236535,
      "endMs": 1238503
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Piece of cake, son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1240372,
